ay-threethings.html</guid><description>低谷期只需要在乎三件事：你自己，你的钱，你内心的平静。</description><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>泡沫消散之后</title><link>https://www.raychan.top/essay-foam.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.raychan.top/essay-foam.html</guid><description>人只能活在真实的爱、到手的钱和落地的实事中。</description><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>真实的 PDCA</title><link>https://www.raychan.top/essay-pdca.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.raychan.top/essay-pdca.html</guid><description>Plan-delay-cancel-apologize。</description><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>不是做错什么，而是没做对什么</title><link>https://www.raychan.top/essay-right.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.raychan.top/essay-right.html</guid><description>有时候不是你做错什么，而是你没做对什么。</description><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>选择的代价</title><link>https://www.raychan.top/essay-choice.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.raychan.top/essay-choice.html</guid><description>关于选择与代价的思考：每个选择都有价格，只是高低不同。</description><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Kat Wu × Lenny 播客访谈</title><link>https://www.raychan.top/note-katwu-lenny.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.raychan.top/note-katwu-lenny.html</guid><description>Anthropic Cloud Code 产品负责人 Kat Wu 与 Lenny Rachitsky 的深度访谈：AI 时代的产品管理、团队协作与职业发展。</description><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>尝试的意义</title><link>https://www.raychan.top/essay-trial.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.raychan.top/essay-trial.html</guid><description>几乎所有的尝试都是有用的，至少在排除错误项方面。</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>《原则》读书笔记</title><link>https://www.raychan.top/note-principles.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.raychan.top/note-principles.html</guid><description>Ray Dalio《原则》读书笔记：关于决策、进化、现实的思考摘抄。</description><pubDate>